                <head>CH–39. Editorial Note</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian" when="1960-06-29"
                            >June 29, 1960</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>By an exchange of notes at Washington, June 29, 1960, entered into force on the
                    same date, representatives of the United States and Chile signed an agreement
                    providing for emergency relief assistance necessitated by the recent disasters
                    in Chile. For text of the agreement, see 11 UST
                    (pt. 2) 1777.</p>
            </div>
